# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The music modes (Cheer Mode / Fire Mode) use YouTube's official embed player
# and need no API keys or environment variables at all — playback works out of
# the box. This file exists only as a template for future additions.
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in values as needed:
#   Copy-Item .env.example .env.local
#
# Never commit real secrets. Anything prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_ is exposed to
# the browser and must never contain a secret.
YOUTUBE_API_KEY=AIzaSyDxjr-CtgK4u81ytEiZGBVodndgIEM6COk